      },
      "message": "docs: needs-research issues are research, not code - break them down first\n\nThe needs-research label marks a large idea with open questions. It is\nnot picked for code: its work is answering the questions in comments and\nfiling concrete sub-issues (each with P*, area:*, Done means, Part of #N),\nthen closing the umbrella. README's Issues section explains it to\ncontributors; AGENTS.md's Pick query excludes it and a new Issue Law\nbullet says how agents work one (user, 2026-11-08).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
