      },
      "message": "docs: a researched umbrella is closed, never kept open; research is claimed\n\nReview of #294: keeping a needs-research umbrella open without the label\nwould let Pick take it for code. The umbrella is now always closed once\nits sub-issues are filed (user: \"broken down into issues and closed\"),\nand researching one is claimed like any issue but takes no branch, PR or\nlane slot.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
